WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.971
Taking payment can be simple.

00:00:01.971 --> 00:00:04.729
Stripe, PayPal, or manual first is fine.

00:00:04.729 --> 00:00:07.488
This lesson is about taking payment simply.

00:00:07.488 --> 00:00:08.276
Stripe/PayPal/manual first.

00:00:08.276 --> 00:00:11.035
Do not treat this as theory only.

00:00:11.035 --> 00:00:14.976
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

00:00:14.976 --> 00:00:20.888
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

00:00:20.888 --> 00:00:25.223
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

00:00:25.223 --> 00:00:29.952
Stay practical: pick a payment path before you optimize branding or tools.

00:00:30.272 --> 00:00:33.549
Pick one payment path you can set up today.

00:00:33.549 --> 00:00:34.641
Friction kills yeses.

00:00:34.641 --> 00:00:37.190
Remember the objective: pick a payment path.

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:41.195
Write the idea in your own words before you move on.

00:00:41.195 --> 00:00:45.564
Name one concrete next action you can finish in under an hour.

00:00:45.564 --> 00:00:49.570
Avoid vanity work that feels busy but does not create proof.

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:53.939
If something is unclear, simplify the promise and try a smaller version.

00:00:53.939 --> 00:00:56.488
Talk to a real person when possible.

00:00:56.488 --> 00:00:57.944
Feedback beats guessing alone.

